<html>

<head>
    <title>Characters</title>
    <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>

<body>
    {% include "navigation.njk" %}
    {# Character images #}
    <div class="character-intro">
        <div class="character-card">
            <img src="/images/anxiety.PNG" />
            <div class="character-text">
                <h4>Anxiety</h4>
                <p>Lives at: the 3AM Convenience Store</p>
                <p>Anxiety never really sleeps. You'll find them sitting in the convenience store long after midnight,
                    rereading
                    the
                    same
                    text message and checking if the door is locked one more time. They always have a backup plan, and a
                    backup
                    plan
                    for the
                    backup plan.</p>
                <p>Personality: careful, restless</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="character-card">
            <div class="character-text">
                <h4>Calm</h4>
                <p>Lives at: the River</p>
                <p>Calm spends most days sitting by the water, watching the current go by. They're the quiet ones in
                    town.
                    When
                    everyone
                    else is in panic, Calm is the one who says, “Let's take a breath first.”</p>
                <p>Personality: steady, patient</p>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/calm.PNG" />
        </div>

        <div class="character-card">
            <img src="/images/joy.PNG" />
            <div class="character-text">
                <h4>Joy</h4>
                <p>Lives at: the Theme Park</p>
                <p>Joy can't sit still. They're always the ones who laugh the loudest and pull everyone else along. Joy
                    notices
                    the
                    small
                    things and turns them into a celebration.</p>
                <p>Personality: chaotic, optimistic</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="character-card">
            <div class="character-text">
                <h4>Anger</h4>
                <p>Lives at: the Tower</p>
                <p>Anger lives at the very top of the tower, where they can see everything and everyone. They need a
                    place
                    for
                    them
                    to let
                    off steam. They're loud and easily irritated, especially when they disagree with something.</p>
                <p>Personality: fiery, direct</p>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/anger.PNG" />
        </div>
    </div>






</body>

</html>